{"id":"wb-8-412","name":"大埔光禄第","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"张弼士故居 (梅州)","text":"光禄第位于中国广东省梅州市大埔县西河镇车龙村，是梅州清代企业家张弼士的故居，光禄第建于清光绪三十四年（公元1908年），建筑面积4180平方米，为典型的三堂四横一围客家围屋，共有18个厅、13个大井、99个房间。2013年成为中国国家3A级景区。2019年10月7日公布为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%A0%E5%BC%BC%E5%A3%AB%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85_(%E6%A2%85%E5%B7%9E)","revisionId":92314978,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92314978","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e89506ccdda8f1de6e522aef.jpg","title":"Entrance_to_Guang_Lu_Di_(19950561421).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Entrance_to_Guang_Lu_Di_(19950561421).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/92/Entrance_to_Guang_Lu_Di_%2819950561421%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yun Huang Yong from Harbord, Australia","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","caption":"Entrance to Guang Lu Di","width":320,"height":213}}